{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0194","paragraphs":[{"id":"pf39c35a782a6-1","text":"波面铜花冷不收。"},{"id":"p62fbc0fd18c1-1","text":"玉人垂钓理纤钩。"},{"id":"pb3bb926468a3-1","text":"月明池阁夜来秋。"},{"id":"p6cb427cd938e-1","text":"江燕话归成晓别，水花红减似春休。"},{"id":"p292dc492c66e-1","text":"西风梧井叶先愁。"}]}